                                "sense_id": "8e0546e3-b2a4-3084-b074-48a38bdbd4c9",
                                "text": "I must have a definite mark by which to locate him in that rugged territory overstream."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0542a063-71e6-46f9-bfdf-bd22acee385c",
                                "sense_id": "8e0546e3-b2a4-3084-b074-48a38bdbd4c9",
                                "text": "Water temperature can be altered with the removal of overstream canopy. Water temperatures can increase in summer and decrease in winter encouraging lethal anchor ice problems."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7a43724-e43a-4742-bc8e-f6b21618c668",
                                "sense_id": "8e0546e3-b2a4-3084-b074-48a38bdbd4c9",
                                "text": "The day had open fair, but they had not sailed an hour before the sky was darkened, noisy wind was blowing in changing ways, and an overstream of air came down that was stinging, numbing cold."
                            }
                        ]
